CVE-2026-41845: Escape backtick and dollar in JavaScriptUtils

Refine JavaScriptUtils#javaScriptEscape to escape '`' and '$' so values
cannot break out of JavaScript template literals (XSS).

Origin: upstream, https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-framework/commit/a1826b725c29fbb175fa7b4fc005aa3d78c32015
Bug: CVE-2026-41845
Also includes CI build hardening: remove Gradle Enterprise plugins / buildScan toolchain hooks and set javadoc failOnError=false.

